			<DisplayName>Mk-45 Mod 4</DisplayName>
			<Description>
			The latest Mk-45 Mod. 4 (5-inch/62-caliber) version consist of a longer barrel L62 Mark 36 gun fitted on the same Mark 45 mount.
			The gun is designed for use against surface warships and shore bombardment to support amphibious operations.

			Max engagement range: 5000m
			Rate of Fire: 20
			Reload Time: 8 Seconds
			Ammo: mark45 127mm Shell
			</Description>
			<Icon>Textures\GUI\Icons\TTMK45Mod4.dds</Icon>
			<CubeSize>Large</CubeSize>
			<BlockTopology>TriangleMesh</BlockTopology>
			<Size x="3" y="2" z="3"/>
			<ModelOffset x="0" y="0" z="0"/>
			<Model>Models\Cubes\large\TTMK45Mod4.mwm</Model>
			<Components>
				<Component Subtype="SteelPlate" Count="350" />
